<title>JAPAN: I-O Data rises to new high for 1997.</title>
<headline>I-O Data rises to new high for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of I-O Data Device Inc rose sharply to a new high for the calendar year on Wednesday morning.</p>
<p>Traders said that a recent buying trend in high-technology issues had spread those on the over-the-counter (OTC) market.</p>
<p>At 0148 GMT I-O Data, which manufactures personal computer peripheral equipment, was up 240 yen at 4,410. It briefly reached 4,450, a new 1997 high. Turnover was 65,900 shares.</p>
</text>
